    <dashboard name='Combos - Sales Performance' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text />
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ComboProducts/Combos-SalesPerformance?rev=' id='Combos-SalesPerformance' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ComboProducts_16939327994290' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='131' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1100' maxwidth='1730' minheight='1100' minwidth='1730' preset-index='1' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98546' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99076' x='462' y='727'>
            <zone h='909' id='3' type-v2='title' w='99076' x='462' y='727' />
            <zone fixed-size='106' h='9636' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='99076' x='462' y='1636' />
            <zone h='88001' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='99076' x='462' y='11272'>
              <flipboard active-id='15' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='User Guide and Definitions' captured-sheet='User Guide and Definitions' id='12'>
                    <capturedDeltas>
                      <dashboard name='User Guide and Definitions'>
                        <zone id='6'>
                          <formatted-text>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Overview:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows stacked with the distribution of combos and non-combo orders and GBV on a time series.

- The first chart shows the country/region level snapshot of combo and non-combo orders.

- The second chart shows the country/region level snapshot of the GBV of combo and non-
combo orders.

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>GBV</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>:- Gross Basket Value of the order. 

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Overview - Deepdive:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows stacked with the distribution of combos and non-combo orders and GBV over a time series.

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>ABS and ABV:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab encaptures the ABS and ABV for different countries/region and across the timeseries.

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>ABS:- </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Average Basket Size. </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Formula:- </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Sum quantity of items sold in orders / Sum of orders</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>ABV:- </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Average Basket Value.</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Formula:- </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Sum of GBV of the orders / Sum of orders</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Country/Region Vs Country/Region Analysis:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

In this tab, the user can do a country to country or a region to region analysis between  metrics selected.

For example:- For you can visualize at the ABS in one graph and in the other graph you can visualize the same metric for country or region B.
</run>
                          </formatted-text>
                        </zone>
                        <zone id='7'>
                          <formatted-text>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Unique Combos Sold:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows the distinct/unique combos sold by each country/region in a given time period. Also, it shows the the trend of distinct combos sold over a timeseries.

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Combos - Active As of Yesterday:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab has a view of combos that were active on a Country level as of Yesterday. 

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Combos Sold:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab represents the combo-level sales information.
Furthermore, the </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Bundle quantity </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>represents the individual quantity of the child SKU present in the combo. </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combos sold </run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>represents the number of combos sold that had this child SKU. </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combo quantity</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'> is the quantity of the multiplication of the </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Bundle quantity</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'> and the </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combos sold</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'> to achieve the overall quantity sold for each child SKU in the combo.

</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Child SKU - Combos Sold:</run>
                            <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab breaksdown the combo-level information to the child SKUs in the individual combos.
It represents the quantity sold of child SKUs in a combo.

</run>
                          </formatted-text>
                        </zone>
                      </dashboard>
                    </capturedDeltas>
                  </story-point>
