    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='User Guide and Definitions'>
      <repository-location id='UserGuideandDefinitions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ComboProducts_16939327994290' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_3' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_18' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_19' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_8' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1300' minheight='900' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone fixed-size='93' forceUpdate='true' h='17163' id='4' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='64944' x='34441' y='889'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='30'>Combo Products</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='12'>QUICK-COMMERCE</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='99' h='17163' id='3' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/deliveryhero .png' type-v2='bitmap' w='33826' x='615' y='889'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='72289' id='6' type-v2='text' w='52231' x='615' y='26822'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Overview:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows stacked with the distribution of combos and non-combo orders and GBV on a time series.

- The first chart shows the country/region level snapshot of combo and non-combo orders.

- The second chart shows the country/region level snapshot of the GBV of combo and non-
combo orders.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>GBV</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>:- Gross Basket Value of the order. 

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Overview - Deepdive:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows stacked with the distribution of combos and non-combo orders and GBV over a time series.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>ABS and ABV:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab encaptures the ABS and ABV for different countries/region and across the timeseries.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>ABS:- </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Average Basket Size. </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Formula:- </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Sum quantity of items sold in orders / Sum of orders</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>ABV:- </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Average Basket Value.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Formula:- </run>
              <run fontalignment='1' italic='true'>Sum of GBV of the orders / Sum of orders</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Country and Region Analysis:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

In this tab, the user can do a country to country or a region to region analysis between different metrics selected.

For example:- For you can visualize at the ABS and the ABV of Country in one graph and in the other graph you can visualize the same metrics for country or region B.
</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='72289' id='7' type-v2='text' w='46539' x='52846' y='26822'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Unique Combos Sold:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab shows the distinct/unique combos sold by each country/region in a given time period. Also, it shows the the trend of distinct combos sold over a timeseries.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Combos - Active As of Yesterday:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab has a view of combos that were active on a Country level as of Yesterday. 

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Combos Sold - Combo-level:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>
This tab breaksdown the combo-level information. The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Minimum Combo Quantity </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>represents the summation of the individual quantity of the child SKU present in the combo. The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combo Quantity </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>is the summation of the individual combo quantities of the child sku.  The </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combos Sold </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>is the division of the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combo Quantity </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>divided by the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Minmum Combo Quantity.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='16'>Combos Sold - Child SKU-level:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>

This tab breaksdown the combo-level information to the child SKUs in the individual combos.
Furthermore, the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Minimum Combo Quantity </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>represents the individual quantity of the child SKU present in the combo. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combos Sold </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>represents the number of combos sold that had this child SKU. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combo Quantity</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'> is the quantity of the multiplication of the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Minimum Combo Quantity</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'> and the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Combos Sold</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'> to achieve the overall quantity sold for each child SKU in the combo.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='93' forceUpdate='true' h='5170' id='8' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='18052'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c42f45' fontsize='22'>User Guide and Definitions</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='3600' id='13' param='Image/Screenshot 2021-07-12 at 15.39.29.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98770' x='615' y='23222'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
